          <tr>
            <td><b>${esc(l.title)}</b></td>
            <td>${fmtDate(l.loan_date)}</td>
            <td>${fmtDate(l.return_date)}</td>
          </tr>`).join('')}
      </table></div>` : '<p class="empty">Nenhum item devolvido ainda.</p>'}
